onal","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu:line016:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"孫權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu:line016:m0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"太史慈","kind":"person","person_id":"s52_ysc_gyl","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu:line016:m0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"周瑜","kind":"person","person_id":"f56_938_997","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu:line016:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"曹公","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_b77_b38","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu:line016:m0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"曹仁","kind":"person","person_id":"8po_0xd_0vn","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":16,"last_line":16,"revision_id":2603286,"raw_start":523,"raw_end":626,"character_positions":[530,531,532,533,534,535,536,537,538,539,540,541,542,543,544,545,546,547,548,549,550,551,552,553,554,555,556,557,558,559,560,561,562,563,564,565,566,567,568,569,570,571,572,573,574,575,576,577,578,579,580,581,582,583,584,585,586,587,588,589,590,591,592,593,594,595,596,597,598,599,600,601,602,603,604,605,606,607,608,609,610,611,612,613,614,615,616,617,618,619,620,621,622,623,624,625]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-055-chengpu","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-055","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-055-chengpu"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047","text":"　　是時下邳陳瑀自號吳都太守，住海西，與強族嚴白虎交通。策自將討虎，別遣範與徐逸攻瑀於海西，梟其大將陳牧。又從攻祖郎於陵陽，太史慈於勇裡。七縣平定，拜征虜中郎將，征江夏，還平鄱陽。策薨，奔喪於吳。後權復征江夏，範與張昭留守。曹公至赤壁，與周瑜等俱拒破之，拜裨將軍，領彭澤太守，以彭澤、柴桑、歷陽為奉邑。劉備詣京見權，範密請留備。後遷平南將軍，屯柴桑。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-056-lvfan:line047:m000